list.item:
Bennett, William J., “Bill,” Chair,
                                National Endowment for the Humanities from 1981 until 1985;
                                Secretary of Education from 1985 until 1988

Boggs, Danny, Office of Policy
                                Development, Executive Office of the President from 1981 until 1983;
                                Deputy Secretary of Energy from 1983 until 1986

person.note:
Associate Director, Office of Planning and Inventory, from 1981 until 1982;
                    Office of Policy Development, Executive Office of the President, from 1982 until
                    1985; Executive Secretary, Domestic Policy Council, from 1985 until 1988

Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for European Affairs from 1982 until 1983;
                    Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for European and Canadian Affairs from 1983
                    until 1985

Associate Director, Office of Management and Budget from 1982 until 1986;
                    member, National Security Council Staff; Deputy National Security Assistant to
                    the President

Principal Deputy Legal Adviser, Department of State, from 1982 until 1988;
                    Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Inter-American Affairs from 1988 until
                    1991

Administrator, Agency for International Development from 1981 until 1987;
                    Chairman of the Board, Overseas Private Investment Corporation, from 1981 until
                    1987; Deputy Secretary of the Treasury from 1987 until 1989

Chairman of the Derg and Head of State of Ethiopia from 1977 until 1987;
                    General Secretary of the Workers’ Party of Ethiopia from 1984 until 1991;
                    President of Ethiopia from 1987 until 1991

U.S. Ambassador at Large and Special Representative of President Jimmy Carter
                    for the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea from 1977 until 1980;
                    attorney-at-law, Milbank, Tweed, Hadley and McCloy

Associate Director, Office of Management and Budget from 1981 until 1982;
                    Under Secretary of State for Security Assistance, Science, and Technology from
                    1982 until 1986

Acting Assistant Legal Adviser for Human Rights, Department of State;
                    Assistant Legal Adviser for Human Rights and Refugees, Department of
                    State
